{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a series of surreal, dreamlike environments where repetition becomes a source of growing discomfort. You\u2019ll revisit the same spaces again and again, yet something always feels... off. Subtle details shift. Layouts change when you\u2019re not looking. What once felt safe and familiar begins to betray you, warping into something alien and wrong. Each interaction, no matter how small, chips away at the thin layer of reality holding everything together. You\u2019re not solving puzzles in the traditional sense. Instead, you're unraveling a fractured consciousness, one eerie encounter at a time. With every step, the line between your mind and the madness you're exploring begins to blur. You are not alone in here. But you may be the only thing left that\u2019s real.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Click","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582390/dc69e77c75551ad968b4e97f0530c69764ee7e5a.jpg"},{"name":"Puzzle in the Dark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582390/a617b286f7e1c2153ffd97db7a365b274263f27a.jpg"},{"name":"Echoes of the Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582390/5bc797a2d7ba1bb97955ede47949ff337ed0b77c.jpg"},{"name":"In the mouth of Illness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582390/a55bed95272e7836c18126f4e17b21d8c0b79db4.jpg"},{"name":"Teachers Aren't Alright","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582390/096645c094cacf9d4e9cacb1342550ed4959d983.jpg"},{"name":"Darkness Rising","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582390/e738b9909cf3227d501571975e107c4bc01feb62.jpg"},{"name":"One Last Piece","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582390/d7ca092457daa5eea6f8d3f03faa828880788cc7.jpg"},{"name":